source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A backslash before the closing delimiter kills the candidate whatever the run length, so Jira finds no closer and renders the line literally; jiro keeps it as text.
-- input.jira --
*ab\\\\* c
-- rendered.html --
<p>*ab\\\\* c</p>
-- want.md --
\*ab\\\\\\\\\* c
-- warnings.json --
[]
